{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">上月尾上市的中際旭創，上半年按年多賺兩倍四，純利136.5億元人民幣。中期息每10股派12元人民幣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內收入417.7億元人民幣，上升一倍八。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T23:39:25.324284+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}